{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Jobab the son of Zerah from Bozrah.</b> Bozrah is one of the cities of Moab, as it says ״וְעַל קְרִיּוֹת וְעַל בָּצְרָה וגו׳״ (Jeremiah 48); and because it established a king for Edom, it is destined to be struck with them, as it says ״כִּי זֶבַח לַה׳ בְּבָצְרָה״ (Isaiah 34)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:18.710462757Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}